  "method": "Copied from the npm-publication-verification artifact of publish-npm.yml run 37327425339 (attempt 2), produced by scripts/verify-npm-publication.mjs in its verify-publication job. The owner downloaded the artifact; the file was reconstructed from their paste and matched its SHA256 before these fields were copied. channels is the registry state after next was moved; channelsAtVerification is what the job saw.",
  "scope": "Publication verification of the CI-tested rc.15 artifact, published by publish-npm.yml with npm provenance. rc.15 adds integer clocks, history windows with retirement, a checked caveat test with the C006 advisory, and a Lean model of reopening. Retirement does not yet remove records from the save. Restore validation does not authenticate saved history. Existing Lean checks remain bounded to their documented fragment; no broader proof or adoption claim is introduced."
